    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga, Jesu kala anafundza atu na kutangaza habari nono za Mlungu ndani ya Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu. Hipho, akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka, alimu a Shariya, na vilongozi anjina akpwedzabisha naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achimuamba, “Huambire, gano unagogahenda, unahenda kpwa uwezo wa ani? Ni ani yekupha uwezo huno?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiaambira, “Nami nindakuuzani swali, niambirani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dze, uwezo wa Johana wa kubatiza wala kpwa Mlungu hebu wala kpwa atu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara vilongozi aphiya njama kpwendabisha, achiamba, “Huchiamba, ‘Wala mlunguni,’ andahuamba, ‘Sambi mbona tamyamkuluphira?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na huchiamba, ‘Wala kpwa atu,’ atu osi andahupiga mawe, mana kpwa kpweli anaamini kukala Johana kala ni nabii.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, amuamba Jesu, “Tahumanya uwezowe urikola.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiaambira, “Wala nami sindakuambirani nahenda mambo higa kpwa uwezo wa ani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 5:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu waatsuphira atu ndarira achiamba, “Kpwakala na mutu mmwenga yephanda mizabibu mwakpwe mundani, na hura munda achiukodishira akurima. Alafu achiphiya tsi yanjina kpwa muda wa kukola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati wa kuvuna zabibu uriphofika, mchina-munda wahuma mtumishiwe aphiye kpwa hara ariokodisha mundawe ili akahewe fungure ra mavuno. Ela hara ariokodisha hura munda ampiga na achimuuyiza mikono mihuphu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu mchina-munda wahuma mtumishi wanjina, ela naye ampiga, achimuhenda mambo ga waibu na achimuusa mikono mihuphu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mchina-munda achihuma mutu wa hahu. Hiye naye ampiga na achimlumiza, chisha achimtsupha kondze ya munda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phahi yuya mchina-munda waamba, ‘Sambi mino nihendedze? Si chitu, nindamhuma mwanangu mwenye nimmendzaye, mwanangu nimmendzaye sana, naona andamuishimu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hara akurima ariokodisha hura munda ariphomuona yuya mwanangbwa, aima njama, achiambirana, ‘Hiyu ni mwanawe ndiyemrisi, phahi nahumuolageni ili huno munda ukale wehu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho amtuluza kondze ya hura munda na achimuolaga. Dze! Ye mchina-munda achedza, andaahendadze hara akurima ariokodisha hura munda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andakpwedza aaolage, na hura munda aukodishe akurima anjina.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hara atu phosikira hivyo, aamba, ‘Hunavoya dzambo dza hiri risihendeke kabisa!’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 118:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jesu waatongʼorera matso, chisha achiamba, “Sambi mana ga Maandiko gano nini?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hara alimu a Shariya na akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka amanya kala akagomba ndarira iyo kuonyesa kala aho ndio akurima ayi ariokodisha hura munda. Kpwa hivyo alonda kumgbwira Jesu mara mwenga, ela achimricha kpwa kuogopha atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi amchunguza chila ahendaro na achihuma apelelezi ambao adzihenda avi ni aaminifu. Nia yao kala ni kumgbwira na manenoge agombago ili amshitaki kpwa liwali wa jimbo ra Chirumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hara achunguzi amuamba Jesu, “Mwalimu, hunamanya kala manenogo na mafundzogo ni ga kpweli na ga haki, wala kuonera mutu, ela unafundza kpweli kuhusu Mlungu alagizago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, ni shariya kuripha kodi kpwa Kaisari, mtawala wa Chirumi, hebu si shariya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu wamanya werevu wao, hipho waamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nionyesani pesa mwenga. Dze, pesa hino ina sura na dzina ra ani?” Nao achimuamba, “Ni vya Kaisari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho achiaambira, “Phahi, vya Kaisari mupheni Kaisari, na vya Mlungu, mupheni Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho, taayaweza kumgbwira kpwa maneno achigogomba mbere za atu, ela aangalazwa ni majibuge na achikala taana ra kuamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
