            "sid": "LUK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achiaamba, “Hipha sambi alume na achetu analólana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela wakati wedzao, atu ambao Mlungu andaona anafwaha kufufulwa na kuishi tsona wakati hinyo, taandalólana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kpweli taandafwa tsona, mana andakala dza malaika na ni ana a Mlungu, ahendafufulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kuhusu atu kufufulwa, si Musa wakuhakikishirani chingʼangʼa ariphoandika kuhusu chitsaka chokala chinaaka moho. Mana Musa anamhadza Bwana dza Mlungu wa Burahimu, wa Isaka na wa Jakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:37",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ndani ya chitabu cha Kutsama 3, Musa waandika gara arigoambirwa ni Mlungu. Mlungu wamuamba kukala iye ni Mlungu wa Burahimu, wa Isaka na wa Jakobo miaka minji bada ya atu hinya kufwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo iye si Mlungu wa atu ariofwa, ela ni Mlungu wa ario moyo, mana kpwakpwe anadamu osi a moyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
